    },
    "An idle virtual machine is suspended to give its memory back to the Mac; opening one of its programs from the Mac resumes it. It is never suspended while it is in use: while you work in it, while its processor is busy, while something inside it asked to stay awake (in the guest: tandem-agent keep-awake -- <command>), or while Keep awake is on. Closing its window does not suspend it." : {

