    },
    "Lets an AI assistant connected with `tandem mcp` work with your virtual machines, as far as each VM’s AI level allows (Configure > Options > Sharing > AI tools): Observe looks, Operate starts, stops and snapshots, Full can also revert, clone and power off. Running commands inside a VM needs its “Commands from the Mac” permission too. Off by default." : {

    },
