    "Tandem helper (network and USB):" : {

    },
    "Tandem installs only updates signed with its release key and by the same developer, and never while a virtual machine runs." : {

    },
    "Tandem is up to date" : {

    },
    "Tandem makes this account in the new system. The password is kept on a setup disc inside the virtual machine until its first start has finished, then that disc is deleted.%@" : {

    },
